OL,4,BRussell says Verstappen's criticism    
OL,5,B'quite amusing'                        
OL,6,GGeorge Russell has said Max Verstappen 
OL,7,Gcan "say what he wants" and explained  
OL,8,Ghe found the Red Bull driver's         
OL,9,Gcriticisms of him after the Las Vegas  
OL,10,GGrand Prix "quite amusing".            
OL,12,FVerstappen said Russell was "so far    
OL,13,Fbelow my level" after winning the race 
OL,14,Fon Saturday.                           
OL,16,FHis remarks were a response to         
OL,17,FMercedes driver Russell saying         
OL,18,F"somebody has to stand up to this guy" 
OL,19,Fafter an on-track confrontation in     
OL,20,Fpractice.                              
